{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"They hold memories.\" She says simply and moves to the kitchen to make some tea again","created_at":"2020-08-04T23:37:01.821000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740352628919369748","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"How so?\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T23:37:59.621000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740352871350140959","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"Memories do not simply exist in our minds. We leave our mark on the things around us. They hold memories in different ways.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T23:39:59.307000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740353373349347408","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"Do you. Have ways to access them? Ones we cannot find anymore?\" (I am not referring to the memories of Arc)","created_at":"2020-08-04T23:40:57.149000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740353615956541561","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"I don't know. The Raven Queen is fond of memories, and how they work within life and death. She collects them, and like a raven I do the same.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T23:42:51.685000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740354096355082324","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"I have never met anyone who has lost a memory. It's not a common thing to come across.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T23:44:06.218000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740354408969273454","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"I have some lost, but I am referring to some I don't have access to anymore.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T23:45:10.150000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740354677119516673","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"They aren't lost. Moreso my brain doesn't think my heart can handle seeing them anymore.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T23:45:38.144000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740354794534994028","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
